<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Китч - Подобрать рецепт</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #FFF7EC;
        color: #312822;
      }

      .page {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 16px 32px 80px;
      }

      /* HEADER - такой же как на главной */

      .header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 8px 0 36px;
      }

      .logo {
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        flex: 1;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .nav-item {
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 13px;
        background: #FFF3E3;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .nav-item.active {
        background: #FFB991;
        color: #5B2A14;
      }

      .nav-item.icon-left {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
      }

      .nav-icon {
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        background: #312822;
      }

      .header-right {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .ghost-pill {
        font-size: 12px;
        opacity: 0.6;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        padding: 8px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 13px;
        background: #FFE4C8;
        border: 1px solid #F7D2AB;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      /* TITLE */

      .center-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      /* OPTIONS BLOCKS */

      .options-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: stretch;
      }

      .option-card {
        flex: 1 1 0;
        max-width: 460px;
        height: 280px;
        border-radius: 32px;
        background: #F8EBDD;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .option-card.secondary {
        background: #FFE3D1;
      }

      .option-inner {
        max-width: 220px;
      }

      .option-icon {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin: 0 auto 10px;
        background: #312822;
        position: relative;
      }

      .option-icon::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 5px;
        border: 2px solid #FFF7EC;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      .option-icon.camera::before {
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .option-title {
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .option-time {
        font-size: 12px;
        opacity: 0.65;
      }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .page {
          padding-inline: 16px;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 720px) {
        .header {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: 10px;
        }
        .nav {
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }
        .options-row {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
        .option-card {
          max-width: none;
          width: 100%;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <header class="header">
        <div class="logo">КИТЧ</div>

        <nav class="nav">
          <div class="nav-item icon-left active">
            <div class="nav-icon"></div>
            <span>Подобрать рецепт</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nav-item">Главная</div>
          <div class="nav-item icon-left">
            <div class="nav-icon"></div>
            <span>Планёр</span>
          </div>
        </nav>

        <div class="header-right">
          <div class="ghost-pill"></div>
          <button class="btn-primary">Создать аккаунт</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <h1 class="center-title">Что у вас есть из продуктов?</h1>

      <section class="options-row">
        <div class="option-card">
          <div class="option-inner">
            <div class="option-icon"></div>
            <div class="option-title">Ввести продукты вручную</div>
            <div class="option-time">~ 5 мин</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="option-card secondary">
          <div class="option-inner">
            <div class="option-icon camera"></div>
            <div class="option-title">Распознать продукты по фото</div>
            <div class="option-time">&lt; 2 мин</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
